{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 153,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.9038696289062,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "For DCE, a total of 234 participants completed this activity (186 providers and 48 consumers).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.806640625,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "Overall, 59% of respondents were female and 56% were aged 36–55 years; the main countries",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.977527618408203,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.8350830078125,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "in which respondents were based were India (26%), the USA (16%), South Africa (9%), Pakistan",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.96168327331543,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        199.73109436035156,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "(8%) and Zimbabwe (7%).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        139.66522216796875,
        473.2401123046875,
        152.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "The conclusions were based on the predefined research questions outlined below.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        163.82313537597656,
        527.1793212890625,
        176.7371368408203
      ],
      "text": "Is there important uncertainty about or variability in how much end-users value the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        179.32313537597656,
        156.8860321044922,
        192.2371368408203
      ],
      "text": "main outcomes?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        203.17303466796875,
        527.13525390625,
        216.3180389404297
      ],
      "text": "Qualitative data from the systematic reviews and end-user interviews, and quantitative data from",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        218.67303466796875,
        526.5560913085938,
        231.8180389404297
      ],
      "text": "the DCE indicated that health care consumers and providers had similar values and preferences",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.971613883972168,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.17303466796875,
        526.8450317382812,
        247.3180389404297
      ],
      "text": "in terms of TB infection tests. Key end-user values included test accuracy, convenience, positive",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.984990119934082,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        249.67303466796875,
        526.9700927734375,
        262.81805419921875
      ],
      "text": "patient experience, cost and resource requirements. In particular, end-users valued tests with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        265.17303466796875,
        526.9590454101562,
        278.31805419921875
      ],
      "text": "high accuracy such as TBST and IGRAs (i.e. low false positive and false negative rates), because",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        280.67303466796875,
        527.1187133789062,
        293.81805419921875
      ],
      "text": "they reduce the risk of downstream consequences associated with false positive and false",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        296.17303466796875,
        526.9478759765625,
        309.31805419921875
      ],
      "text": "negative results (e.g. anxiety, and the need for additional testing or unnecessary treatment).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.67303466796875,
        527.0361328125,
        324.81805419921875
      ],
      "text": "End-users also preferred having a test that was convenient to administer and access. This",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        327.1730041503906,
        526.9149780273438,
        340.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "included valuing tests that can be accessed in a community or primary care setting, that do",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        342.6730041503906,
        526.9258422851562,
        355.8180236816406
      ],
      "text": "not require follow-up visits to read test results, and that can be administered without the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        358.1730041503906,
        527.1848754882812,
        371.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "need for additional systems or infrastructure to be developed. These findings were initially",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        373.6730041503906,
        526.9666748046875,
        386.8180236816406
      ],
      "text": "identified from themes emerging from the systematic reviews and end-user interviews, and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        389.1730041503906,
        249.68017578125,
        402.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "were confirmed by the DCE findings.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        413.1769104003906,
        526.9591674804688,
        426.3219299316406
      ],
      "text": "From the qualitative data from the reviews and interviews, all TB infection test options were",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        428.6769104003906,
        527.0084838867188,
        441.8219299316406
      ],
      "text": "found to have strengths and limitations in terms of convenience. End-users valued a positive",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        444.1769104003906,
        526.8229370117188,
        457.3219299316406
      ],
      "text": "consumer experience. This meant that tests with fewer psychological effects (e.g. anxiety, stigma",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        459.6769104003906,
        527.013916015625,
        472.8219299316406
      ],
      "text": "and stress) and physical consequences (e.g. discomfort) were preferred. Tests that were more",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        475.1769104003906,
        527.0030517578125,
        488.3219299316406
      ],
      "text": "accurate tended to be associated with better consumer experience, although some aspects",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        490.6769104003906,
        527.01416015625,
        503.8219299316406
      ],
      "text": "of consumer experience were worse in skin tests (e.g. stigma from the welt and discomfort)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        506.1768798828125,
        526.9810791015625,
        519.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "compared with non-skin-based tests. Low-cost tests were generally preferred due to greater",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.6768798828125,
        527.1790771484375,
        534.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "accessibility in resource-limited contexts (e.g. TBST and the TST). Tests with lower resource",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        537.1768798828125,
        527.2764282226562,
        550.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "requirements were preferred in resource-limited settings (e.g. TBST and the TST); however, this",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.981735229492188,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.6768798828125,
        526.6822509765625,
        565.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "appeared to be less of a consideration in high-income countries. End-users showed a preference",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.947274208068848,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.1768798828125,
        526.9259033203125,
        581.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "towards TB infection tests that used existing infrastructure in their health care setting. Data",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        583.6768798828125,
        526.9216918945312,
        596.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "from the DCE confirmed that not requiring an in-person follow-up appointment and not",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        599.1768798828125,
        526.9644775390625,
        612.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "requiring specialist staff or equipment to interpret or administer the test were important end-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        614.6768798828125,
        222.54310607910156,
        627.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "user preferences for TB testing.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        638.8348999023438,
        305.39483642578125,
        651.7489013671875
      ],
      "text": "What would be the impact on health equity?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        662.684814453125,
        526.7302856445312,
        675.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "Qualitative evidence from reviews and end-user interviews indicates that specific TBSTs are",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        678.184814453125,
        527.13525390625,
        691.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "unlikely to create any new equity issues. Rather, TBSTs are likely to improve health equity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        693.684814453125,
        526.9150390625,
        706.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "through the provision of a more accurate, low-cost test for resource-limited settings where",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        709.184814453125,
        526.8930053710938,
        722.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "the TST is already in use. Moreover, their portability and low cost make them suited to use in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        724.684814453125,
        527.2890625,
        737.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "large-scale screening programmes in vulnerable, hard-to-reach communities. However, it is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        740.184814453125,
        526.9655151367188,
        753.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "possible that TBSTs may not affect health equity in low-resource settings that do not already",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        755.684814453125,
        527.0195922851562,
        768.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "use the TST, because there are barriers to accessing skin and other health care tests in these",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        347.6684875488281,
        802.0169067382812,
        556.809326171875,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "3. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB infection 137",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}